Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi everyone and welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.41,0:00:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start building our reading skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.61,0:00:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And here comes the very first lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.97,0:00:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that all of us can't wait
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,to take the exam right away and make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.23,0:00:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,ourselves familiar with frequently asked questions in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.55,0:00:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it won't be useful unless our reading skills are improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.09,0:00:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is also the very first goal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,that we need to achieve to master IELTS Reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to start the lesson with a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.27,0:00:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,small challenge for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.43,0:00:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,On the next screen, there will be a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You have 10 seconds to look at it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.19,0:00:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and then answer some of my questions related to the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.17,0:00:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,10 seconds starts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.49,0:01:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now let's answer my questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.31,0:01:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Number one, how many people are there in the picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking at the picture quickly, you can see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,that there are three people, a man, a woman and a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They look like a happy family, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.47,0:01:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Number two, is the car running?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.37,0:01:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, obviously the car stays still and even
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.17,0:01:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,the trunk is still open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We will answer one more question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Number three, what's the mother doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.03,0:01:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She's holding her son's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.21,0:01:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.51,0:01:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's answer some more questions still about that picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.15,0:02:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Number one, how many trees are there in the picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.11,0:02:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Which brand of shoes is the woman wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.77,0:02:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Number three, what is the type of the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.01,0:02:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,house in the background?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.89,0:02:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure that if you don't look
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.97,0:02:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,at the photo again, many of you can't
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.73,0:02:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,answer these three questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.07,0:02:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you look back at it, I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.31,0:02:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,not sure you can answer them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.35,0:02:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to do that again to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,find the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So why can you answer the first three
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.21,0:02:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,questions easily, but you can't do the same
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.99,0:02:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,thing with the three latter ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.55,0:02:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the first three sentences show the main
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.67,0:02:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,information of the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.77,0:02:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They tell us what the picture is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.59,0:02:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,In reading, these are called keywords, which are
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.51,0:02:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,really important pieces of information, helping us to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.57,0:02:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,understand the content of a sentence, a paragraph,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.39,0:03:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,or a reading passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The three latter questions are difficult to answer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,because those are small details or minor details.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.07,0:03:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They do not affect the overall meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.35,0:03:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We can ignore them and still understand the main content.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.09,0:03:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,When you read anything not only for IELTS Reading,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,identifying and focusing on keywords,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,ignoring minor details are necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They help you to speed up the reading
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.93,0:03:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,process and get a lot of information in
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,a short period of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.27,0:03:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Our first lesson aims to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.57,0:03:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Number one, remember and understand the definition of keywords.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Number two, understand different types of keywords.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And number three, apply the knowledge of keywords
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.41,0:03:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,to the reading passage through three parts of the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:04:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Number one: Definition of keywords.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.30,0:04:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Number two: Types of keywords
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And number three: Practice identifying keywords\Nin sentences and paragraphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.55,0:04:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you apply these core knowledge to IELTS Reading,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you will find it much easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.47,0:04:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Keywords are words in a sentence, a passage,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.20,0:04:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,a text, and carry the main content that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the writer wants to convey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,These words often have important meaning or serve
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the purpose of placing emphasis based on the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.44,0:04:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,writer's intention.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, we just need to look at these words.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We still understand what the sentence is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.34,0:04:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keywords help us narrow down the amount of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,information we need to read and process questions
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,more quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.72,0:05:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Human brains can only effectively process a certain
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,amount of information at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, selecting what to read will make us
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,increase our reading speed, remember the information better,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.22,0:05:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and be more focused compared to reading all
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the words in a sentence, a paragraph, or a text.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we've understood the definition, we're going to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.54,0:05:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,learn about different types of keywords so that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,we can use them effectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.51,0:05:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,To begin with, I would like to give
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.47,0:05:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,you the following pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Please guess what I'm trying to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.79,0:05:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing in common between these pictures, as
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,you've already seen, is that they are cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,To be more specific, we are talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.35,0:06:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,different types of cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.27,0:06:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In the next screen, please pause the video
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and spend two minutes studying the highlighted keywords
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.83,0:06:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,in two colors in order to see the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.95,0:06:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,differences between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you have your own answers, we'll get
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.81,0:06:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,back to our lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,See you in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.83,0:06:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess most of you notice that the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.55,0:06:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,yellow keywords are proper nouns or acronyms, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.21,0:06:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And the blue keywords are general words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In general, the yellow keywords are called unchangeable keywords
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,or keywords that cannot be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds reasonable, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it's a personal name, we cannot change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.59,0:06:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The blue keywords are changeable keywords
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.70,0:06:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,or the keywords that can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.65,0:07:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,In this example, types can be replaced by kinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They both refer to a particular group of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.31,0:07:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Big can be replaced to large.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.41,0:07:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Good can be replaced with suitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.15,0:07:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Trips can be replaced with journeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They have the same meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.67,0:07:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,In this context, taken off is used when
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,we are talking about a car with a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,removable roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.33,0:07:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we can replace it with removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.81,0:07:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Very can be replaced with extremely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.75,0:07:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Fun can be replaced with exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And the phrase run on means using electricity to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, we can change it to the word use.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.94,0:07:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get more specific about each type, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting with changeable keywords.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:08:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to look at all the changeable
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.14,0:08:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,keywords we just saw in the last example
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'd like you to name the part
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,of speech of those keywords and divide them
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,into four groups for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's spend about one minute doing this exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it fast, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.36,0:08:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one, start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.26,0:08:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,These keywords are divided into four groups corresponding
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,to four parts of speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nouns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Types.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.94,0:08:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Trips.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Verbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.86,0:08:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Taken off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Run on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Big.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Adverbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Very.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When we read a sentence, nouns, verbs, adjectives,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.72,0:09:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,adverbs are the words we need to focus
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.14,0:09:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,on because they will often be the keywords
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,expressing the main content of the sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There are other parts of speech like pronouns,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,prepositions, or articles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We can skip them and still understand the meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's come to unchangeable keywords or keywords
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that cannot be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There are three common types of unchangeable keywords
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,including proper nouns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The main feature of these words is to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.62,0:09:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,capitalize the first letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Names of people, places, companies, and brands are
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,often in this group and these keywords are
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.48,0:09:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,really easy to find because of their capital letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:10:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In our example, there are the names of two cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kia Sorento and Mercedes-Benz GT.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.10,0:10:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Acronyms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.64,0:10:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Acronyms like the word SUV in the paragraph
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.48,0:10:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,introducing the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an acronym for Sport Utility Vehicle
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.64,0:10:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,or our word IELTS.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's also an acronym.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The full phrase is International English Language Testing System.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it is just hard to remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,so you just have to say IELTS.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But remember to pronounce it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not pronounce it like IELT.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.80,0:10:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,While the nouns we only capitalize the first
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,letters, with acronyms we usually capitalize all the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.33,0:10:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,letters which make them easier to identify.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is also a type of keyword we
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,need to pay attention to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.66,0:11:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Numbers are often categorized as unchangeable keywords due
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to their nature of expressing specific quantities which
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,are rarely changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can find metrics, time, and currencies in this group.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, there are about 26 types of cars available.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.42,0:11:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No kidding, that's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.88,0:11:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Until now, the knowledge is quite enough so
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,let's practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start with something simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In the first exercise, your task is very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have some keywords available for you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Within 30 seconds, please divide them into two groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Changeable keywords and unchangeable keywords.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.26,0:11:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In three, two, one, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.62,0:11:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's check together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This exercise is just a warm-up activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It has nothing challenging at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're going to make it a bit more difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.78,0:12:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you some sentences.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please identify the keywords in each sentence and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.06,0:12:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,categorize them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going to pause the video on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.46,0:12:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the next screen to do this task within
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,one minute and then we'll check the answers together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.51,0:12:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here's the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.91,0:12:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is any new vocab, remember to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.77,0:12:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,write them down in your notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish with the most challenging task.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll give you a passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me point out the keywords and categorize them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's spend about five minutes doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pause the video so that you can do
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,it carefully and then check the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.99,0:13:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.87,0:13:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's check together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.59,0:13:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,After this exercise, you will probably wonder why
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.99,0:13:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,all nouns, verbs, adjectives and adverbs are not
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.01,0:13:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,highlighted as keywords.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.23,0:13:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to give you two tips on
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,identifying keywords so that you can narrow down
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.47,0:13:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,the amount of information you have to read
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and increase your reading speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.47,0:13:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The words which are mentioned several times only
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.65,0:13:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,need to be identified once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, in the last reading,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,two words "brands" and "cars" appear continuously,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.58,0:14:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,so identifying them in the first sentence is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.87,0:14:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We can skip them in the remaining sentences.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.47,0:14:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Words with general meanings used for many contexts
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.47,0:14:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,can be omitted, even though they belong to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.23,0:14:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the noun, verb, adjective or adverb group.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.53,0:14:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, to be, have, include, they're, and people, etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.81,0:14:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,By that, we can leave out more information that needs attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.45,0:14:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please note them down so you can practice more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.81,0:14:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We've completed the first skill building lesson of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.61,0:14:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the Reading 4.0 - 5.0 course, which focuses
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,on identifying keywords,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.60,0:14:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,categorizing changeable keywords and unchangeable keywords.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, we've achieved three goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.07,0:15:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The first is remember and understand the definition of keywords.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.31,0:15:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The second, understand different types of keywords.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.49,0:15:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And the third, apply the knowledge of keywords
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.51,0:15:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,to the reading passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.19,0:15:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,See you all in the next lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.63,0:15:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Teacher Francois.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.57,0:15:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
